lane: The relation STORE is partitioned by workspace (AIF-078 I1.2) but the relation PARENT is not -- current_parent_override() is one global string and current_parent_name()/refresh_from_parent_name() resolve through the unscoped find_open_area_by_name_ci, so a refresh standing in one workspace reads another workspace's area; measured live 2026-08-27 with an EMPTY relation store, so it needs no SET RELATION to occur
